      "statement": "create_durable_run sets stream_resumable=False and the Protocol v3 run shape (marker, stream_mode set, stream_subgraphs) so externally-triggered runs configure the correct streaming protocol; without the marker a run streams values only, so the dashboard sees no tools events or subagent namespaces.",
